Set Shell bash
Set Columns 80
Set Rows 17
Set Framerate 10
Set TypingSpeed 50ms

Hide
Type "dune() { ./main.exe; }; clear"
Enter
Wait
Show
Type "dune exec -- examples/camel/main.exe"
Sleep 500ms
Hide
Enter
Wait+Screen /Press Space/
Show

Sleep 1s
Space@3000ms
Space@2100ms
Space@1700ms
Space@4000ms
Space@1800ms
Space@5000ms

Hide
Type "q"
Wait
